/// Coldframe: every fridge in a chain of cold stores reports its temperature. A reading out of range
/// opens an alert and pages someone, a technician claims it and fixes it, and new firmware rolls out a
/// few devices at a time. The devices and the paging vendor are outside the company, played here by
/// mocks in the same stack, and the simulated fleet really does send readings every minute.
system iot.System('config/system.dcfg') : version('2.0.0') {
}
